Zheng Aimin lied.

583
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:45,880
I think both of them are lying.

584
00:29:46,759 --> 00:29:47,759
I'll ask you one more time.

585
00:29:48,359 --> 00:29:48,960
The car...

586
00:29:49,319 --> 00:29:49,960
who was driving?

587
00:29:51,119 --> 00:29:52,000
Officer,

588
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:54,240
how many times do I have to say it?

589
00:29:54,759 --> 00:29:56,720
Chen Qingchun was driving.

590
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:57,680
Are you sure?

591
00:30:00,799 --> 00:30:01,279
Fine.

592
00:30:03,799 --> 00:30:05,720
In the vehicle involved in the crash,

593
00:30:05,720 --> 00:30:08,680
we found blood on the floor mat.

594
00:30:09,920 --> 00:30:10,759
After testing,

595
00:30:11,519 --> 00:30:12,519
the blood collected

596
00:30:12,559 --> 00:30:13,599
and your DNA

597
00:30:13,799 --> 00:30:14,759
came back as an exact match.

598
00:30:16,599 --> 00:30:17,680
Explain that to me.

599
00:30:21,759 --> 00:30:22,359
The car...

600
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:23,920
who was really driving?

601
00:30:31,519 --> 00:30:32,279
Officer...

602
00:30:33,519 --> 00:30:34,319
I admit it.

603
00:30:35,599 --> 00:30:36,559
I was the one driving.

604
00:30:37,720 --> 00:30:38,559
Playing games with me?

605
00:30:38,559 --> 00:30:38,920
No!

606
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:39,359
No, no, no!

607
00:30:39,359 --> 00:30:39,880
I was wrong.

608
00:30:39,920 --> 00:30:41,319
I... I'm really sorry.

609
00:30:41,839 --> 00:30:43,359
Please listen to my explanation!

610
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:45,359
Because I didn't have a license,

611
00:30:45,799 --> 00:30:47,400
and I had been drinking...

612
00:30:47,759 --> 00:30:50,359
It was my first year as bureau director.

613
00:30:50,440 --> 00:30:52,319
I couldn't afford any trouble!

614
00:30:53,359 --> 00:30:54,279
Officer,

615
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:55,559
I was wrong.

616
00:30:55,920 --> 00:30:56,680
I was truly wrong.

617
00:30:57,319 --> 00:30:59,079
I... I had no respect for the law.

618
00:30:59,640 --> 00:31:01,519
I drove drunk without a license.

619
00:31:01,599 --> 00:31:02,319
I accept the punishment.

620
00:31:02,440 --> 00:31:03,519
Whatever the penalty, I'll take it.

621
00:31:03,799 --> 00:31:05,279
But I didn't kill that man!

622
00:31:05,920 --> 00:31:08,200
The killer was Chen Qingchun!

623
00:31:08,799 --> 00:31:11,160
At the 2000 Gao Wusong crash scene,

624
00:31:11,359 --> 00:31:12,839
investigators found

625
00:31:12,839 --> 00:31:14,000
a Five Star Xiaoshao liquor bottle.

626
00:31:14,680 --> 00:31:16,960
Many fingerprints were found on the bottle,

627
00:31:17,759 --> 00:31:19,759
but given the case classification then,

628
00:31:19,920 --> 00:31:21,000
they didn't pursue it further.

629
00:31:21,839 --> 00:31:22,599
However, this time,

630
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:25,400
we took Zheng and Chen's fingerprints

631
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:26,599
and ran a comparison.

632
00:31:26,960 --> 00:31:28,640
The fingerprints on the bottle

633
00:31:28,920 --> 00:31:30,079
and Chen Qingchun's fingerprints

634
00:31:30,400 --> 00:31:31,319
were an exact match.

635
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:34,160
This lead is crucial.

636
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:35,319
Keep digging.

637
00:31:35,559 --> 00:31:36,039
Understood.

638
00:31:37,279 --> 00:31:38,559
I did force-feed him the liquor.

639
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:42,200
But Zheng Aimin made me do it!

640
00:31:43,640 --> 00:31:44,519
If I didn't,

641
00:31:45,799 --> 00:31:46,519
he would beat me.

642
00:31:56,359 --> 00:31:57,720
Let me tell you, Chen Qingchun.

643
00:31:58,039 --> 00:31:59,559
If you want to survive in Lacheng,

644
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:01,400
you do exactly as I say.

645
00:32:02,400 --> 00:32:03,079
Otherwise,

646
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:04,519
both you and your son Chen Yuan

647
00:32:04,920 --> 00:32:05,839
are dead meat.

648
00:32:08,920 --> 00:32:09,519
Take it.

649
00:32:10,359 --> 00:32:11,000
Go.

650
00:32:14,079 --> 00:32:14,799
Hurry up!

651
00:32:24,920 --> 00:32:25,440
Pour it down.

652
00:32:26,079 --> 00:32:26,720
Hurry up!

653
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:33,079
Pour more!

654
00:32:39,839 --> 00:32:40,759
Keep pouring!

655
00:32:49,240 --> 00:32:49,839
It's empty.

656
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:52,319
Come on.

657
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:58,799
Go to the back of the car.

658
00:32:59,039 --> 00:32:59,559
Hurry!

659
00:33:01,599 --> 00:33:02,519
The two of us will...

660
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:04,000
...push the car down.

661
00:33:05,519 --> 00:33:06,519
It won't budge!

662
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:11,400
Push harder!

663
00:33:12,160 --> 00:33:12,640
Three.

664
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:13,519
Two.

665
00:33:48,160 --> 00:33:49,680
I killed that driver.

666
00:33:50,759 --> 00:33:52,960
But Zheng Aimin forced me to do it.

667
00:33:54,559 --> 00:33:56,519
He's the real killer.

668
00:33:57,559 --> 00:34:00,400
You can't let him escape justice.

669
00:34:05,119 --> 00:34:06,400
Now tell us,

670
00:34:07,440 --> 00:34:09,119
why on earth did you kill Cao Jun?

671
00:34:13,000 --> 00:34:15,519
I don't know how he found out about that.

672
00:34:52,079 --> 00:34:52,679
Where's the newspaper?

673
00:34:54,079 --> 00:34:54,679
Thanks.

674
00:35:00,519 --> 00:35:01,079
What are you looking at?

675
00:35:02,079 --> 00:35:02,519
Nothing.

676
00:35:02,519 --> 00:35:03,719
I came... came to see you.

677
00:35:04,360 --> 00:35:05,679
See me? What for?

678
00:35:06,559 --> 00:35:07,519
It's just about...

679
00:35:07,719 --> 00:35:08,199
well...

680
00:35:08,400 --> 00:35:09,440
that layoff issue.

681
00:35:11,280 --> 00:35:12,039
This factory now...

682
00:35:12,519 --> 00:35:13,719
belongs to Ma, not Chen.

683
00:35:13,840 --> 00:35:14,440
Coming to me won't help.

684
00:35:14,559 --> 00:35:15,679
You're... you're highly respected.

685
00:35:15,679 --> 00:35:17,519
C-Could you put in a word with Ma Guowen?

686
00:35:17,639 --> 00:35:18,039
I mean, I...

687
00:35:18,039 --> 00:35:19,719
I've won Model Worker twice!

688
00:35:20,519 --> 00:35:21,400
Look, if you won't help me,

689
00:35:21,440 --> 00:35:22,280
I won't let you leave.

690
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:23,320
Fine, I'll talk, I'll talk!

691
00:35:24,159 --> 00:35:25,400
Alright, thank you!

692
00:35:27,519 --> 00:35:28,039
Thank you, Chief Engineer Chen.

693
00:35:28,039 --> 00:35:28,679
Thank you so much.

694
00:35:28,719 --> 00:35:29,239
You're welcome.

695
00:35:32,159 --> 00:35:32,840
Drive safe!

696
00:35:40,400 --> 00:35:41,280
It's fixed.

697
00:35:44,719 --> 00:35:45,599
Barbershop crew...

698
00:35:45,599 --> 00:35:46,239
How about some barbecue? Home appliance...

699
00:35:46,239 --> 00:35:47,119
Have them... repair team...

700
00:35:47,400 --> 00:35:48,039
Auto repair crew...

701
00:35:48,039 --> 00:35:49,199
It's the Lantern Festival. We're full.

702
00:35:49,199 --> 00:35:50,000
Have some sweet dumplings or something.

703
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:50,719
Chief Engineer Chen.

704
00:35:50,719 --> 00:35:51,159
Right?

705
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:52,599
Chief Engineer Chen.

706
00:35:54,159 --> 00:35:54,880
Attention, fellow workers.

707
00:35:54,880 --> 00:35:55,840
Chief Engineer Chen.

708
00:35:58,159 --> 00:35:58,880
Chief Engineer Chen.

709
00:35:59,320 --> 00:35:59,800
What's up?

710
00:36:00,519 --> 00:36:01,159
Chief Engineer Chen! Chief Engineer Chen!

711
00:36:01,159 --> 00:36:01,920
Stop patting me! Don't pat me!

712
00:36:02,119 --> 00:36:02,880
What are you patting me for?

713
00:36:02,880 --> 00:36:03,400
No, look...

714
00:36:03,719 --> 00:36:04,199
Look at this.

715
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:06,719
In the end, they still...

716
00:36:06,719 --> 00:36:07,599
laid me off.

717
00:36:08,039 --> 00:36:08,599
Did you see that?

718
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:09,239
Wait...

719
00:36:09,239 --> 00:36:10,559
Did you talk to Ma Guowen about this?

720
00:36:10,960 --> 00:36:11,840
I did, I did.

721
00:36:12,159 --> 00:36:13,400
Told him several times.

722
00:36:13,519 --> 00:36:14,599
Then talk to him again.

723
00:36:14,639 --> 00:36:15,039
Then what about me?

724
00:36:15,039 --> 00:36:15,920
What am I supposed to do here?

725
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:17,280
If I bring it up again,

726
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:18,679
he'll fire me too.

727
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:20,159
Let's talk later.

728
00:36:20,679 --> 00:36:21,159
Bye-bye.

729
00:36:21,159 --> 00:36:21,639
Don't "later"!

730
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:22,559
Old Chen!

731
00:36:23,880 --> 00:36:24,519
Cao Jun!

732
00:36:25,119 --> 00:36:26,639
Watch how you talk to the chief engineer!

733
00:36:26,639 --> 00:36:27,239
What's wrong?

734
00:36:27,920 --> 00:36:28,920
Chief Engineer Chen...

735
00:36:28,920 --> 00:36:30,920
is in-laws with the Industry Bureau Chief!

736
00:36:32,039 --> 00:36:32,559
With who?

737
00:36:32,760 --> 00:36:34,199
Zheng Aimin, head of Industry & Commerce.

738
00:36:34,280 --> 00:36:35,079
You didn't know?

739
00:36:36,880 --> 00:36:37,360
Zheng Aimin?

740
00:36:37,360 --> 00:36:38,039
You didn't know about this?

741
00:36:38,519 --> 00:36:40,400
Acting all cocky, talking to him like that

742
00:36:40,639 --> 00:36:42,159
He's bound to make life difficult for you.

743
00:36:45,679 --> 00:36:46,239
Well...

744
00:36:46,639 --> 00:36:47,159
Fine.

745
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:50,199
Ride carefully, don't wipe out!

746
00:36:52,840 --> 00:36:53,599
Tell me...

747
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:55,760
Can a live-in son-in-law really end well?

748
00:36:55,800 --> 00:36:57,079
No way. Honestly.

749
00:36:57,280 --> 00:36:58,360
Look at us, isn't this much better?

750
00:37:02,519 --> 00:37:04,280
That day, my brother suddenly told me

751
00:37:05,360 --> 00:37:06,880
not to destroy that car.

752
00:37:07,639 --> 00:37:08,599
So did you destroy it?

753
00:37:09,199 --> 00:37:09,960
No.

754
00:37:13,440 --> 00:37:14,039
Cao Bing.

755
00:37:14,599 --> 00:37:15,639
You've gotta listen to me.

756
00:37:15,960 --> 00:37:17,920
Whatever you do, don't scrap this car.

757
00:37:18,519 --> 00:37:19,400
Why?

758
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:22,440
Why?

759
00:37:23,679 --> 00:37:24,760
I'm telling you, if you scrap it,

760
00:37:25,199 --> 00:37:26,280
you'll be in serious trouble.

761
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:27,639
Move aside.

762
00:37:28,519 --> 00:37:29,079
Take your hand off.

763
00:37:29,320 --> 00:37:29,760
Don't touch it.

764
00:37:30,199 --> 00:37:31,199
I'm taking pictures here.

765
00:37:32,519 --> 00:37:33,679
Why are you taking pictures?

766
00:37:34,559 --> 00:37:35,199
For what?

767
00:37:35,800 --> 00:37:37,199
Do you know who owns this car?

768
00:37:41,079 --> 00:37:41,519
Who, Bro?

769
00:37:41,559 --> 00:37:42,400
Do you know?

770
00:37:42,840 --> 00:37:43,719
Just tell me.

771
00:37:45,159 --> 00:37:46,159
Why're you so damn nosey?

772
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:47,760
You really wanna know?

773
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:49,440
If you found out,

774
00:37:49,960 --> 00:37:50,880
you'd be a dead man.

775
00:37:53,159 --> 00:37:54,199
Just keep in mind,

776
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:55,719
you can't scrap this car.

777
00:37:56,199 --> 00:37:56,960
That's it. Wait,

778
00:37:57,079 --> 00:37:57,679
wait, Bro.

779
00:37:57,880 --> 00:37:59,159
How do I explain this to Brother Li?

780
00:37:59,559 --> 00:38:00,760
He's the one who said to scrap it.

781
00:38:04,119 --> 00:38:05,400
Or maybe tell Director Zheng...

782
00:38:06,199 --> 00:38:07,360
Look, here's what you do. Just find

783
00:38:07,360 --> 00:38:09,039
a similar one from these junk cars,

784
00:38:09,360 --> 00:38:09,920
smash it up,

785
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:10,400
take a photo,

786
00:38:10,440 --> 00:38:12,360
and say it's scrapped. Problem solved.

787
00:38:14,360 --> 00:38:15,400
I'm heading back to work.

788
00:38:16,119 --> 00:38:18,199
S-So I just lie to Brother Li?

789
00:38:19,199 --> 00:38:20,639
You could tell the truth.

790
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:21,800
But once you do,

791
00:38:21,800 --> 00:38:22,920
you're as good as dead.

792
00:38:24,960 --> 00:38:25,639
Then I won't say a word.

793
00:38:26,719 --> 00:38:27,000
Good.

794
00:38:27,079 --> 00:38:27,599
Wait, Bro,

795
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,000
what about this car?

796
00:38:29,800 --> 00:38:30,320
This car?

797
00:38:31,079 --> 00:38:33,119
J-Just hide it away in some corner.

798
00:38:33,360 --> 00:38:34,360
Keep it out of sight.

799
00:38:34,599 --> 00:38:36,280
And don't touch it unless you have to.

800
00:38:37,239 --> 00:38:37,960
T-That's it.

801
00:38:38,119 --> 00:38:39,039
I-I'm taking off.

802
00:38:39,559 --> 00:38:40,159
Wait...

803
00:38:40,159 --> 00:38:40,840
By the way,

804
00:38:41,679 --> 00:38:43,440
don't go running your mouth to everyone

805
00:38:43,440 --> 00:38:44,239
a-about this.

806
00:38:44,599 --> 00:38:45,360
Don't be such a blabbermouth.

807
00:38:45,360 --> 00:38:45,800
Hear me?

808
00:38:46,199 --> 00:38:46,760
Besides,

809
00:38:46,880 --> 00:38:47,400
I never...

810
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:48,400
I never taught you to do anything.

811
00:38:48,400 --> 00:38:48,880
Just take—

812
00:38:48,880 --> 00:38:49,840
Snap the photos, and you're clean.

813
00:38:49,840 --> 00:38:50,320
You hear me?

814
00:38:50,679 --> 00:38:51,599
You never saw me.

815
00:38:52,320 --> 00:38:52,960
I was never here.

816
00:38:54,920 --> 00:38:56,639
I didn't actually want to kill Cao Jun.

817
00:38:58,039 --> 00:38:59,280
He just wouldn't let it go.

818
00:39:02,079 --> 00:39:03,800
You didn't want to kill him,

819
00:39:04,239 --> 00:39:05,280
yet you did.

820
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:09,239
Confess the details of your crime.

821
00:39:12,760 --> 00:39:14,119
You were the traitor back then,

822
00:39:14,239 --> 00:39:14,599
weren't you?

823
00:39:15,719 --> 00:39:16,840
You're slandering me!

824
00:39:17,320 --> 00:39:17,880
Slander my ass!

825
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:19,000
Am I wrong?

826
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:20,679
You're just a fence-sitter.

827
00:39:21,639 --> 00:39:22,840
You wanted to play both sides,

828
00:39:23,360 --> 00:39:25,119
but seeing Zheng Aimin backed Ma Guowen,

829
00:39:25,199 --> 00:39:26,400
you figured the odds were in their favor,

830
00:39:26,400 --> 00:39:27,559
so you turned traitor on the spot.

831
00:39:27,639 --> 00:39:28,519
You sold us out.

832
00:39:28,519 --> 00:39:28,960
Am I wrong?

833
00:39:29,679 --> 00:39:30,039
Right.

834
00:39:30,239 --> 00:39:30,519
Right.

835
00:39:30,719 --> 00:39:31,079
Fine, okay, okay.

836
00:39:31,079 --> 00:39:31,440
Right, my foot!

837
00:39:31,440 --> 00:39:32,079
Fine, fine, fine.

838
00:39:32,760 --> 00:39:34,719
That betrayal happened over a decade ago.

839
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:35,679
Let's not dwell on it.

840
00:39:36,559 --> 00:39:37,519
Let's talk about the present.

841
00:39:39,559 --> 00:39:41,519
This car looks familiar, doesn't it?

842
00:39:45,239 --> 00:39:47,000
And this car's engine number...

843
00:39:47,920 --> 00:39:48,639
You still remember it, right?

844
00:39:53,400 --> 00:39:55,360
W-What's this?

845
00:39:58,880 --> 00:40:00,280
It's 200,000.

846
00:40:00,719 --> 00:40:02,679
What you owe me.

847
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:04,719
W-When did I ever owe—

848
00:40:04,760 --> 00:40:05,400
For-for-for—

849
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:06,000
Forgot?

850
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:08,440
You can't forget this.

851
00:40:08,920 --> 00:40:10,360
This involves a human life.

852
00:40:12,039 --> 00:40:12,679
But that's fine.

853
00:40:13,519 --> 00:40:14,400
Director Zheng surely remembers.

854
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:15,519
Right, he isn't the director anymore.

855
00:40:15,679 --> 00:40:16,079
Doesn't matter.

856
00:40:17,079 --> 00:40:17,880
We can go ask him together.

857
00:40:17,920 --> 00:40:18,840
H-He knows about this?

858
00:40:19,920 --> 00:40:21,239
What the hell do you want?

859
00:40:24,280 --> 00:40:25,760
I'm going to Hainan.

860
00:40:27,679 --> 00:40:29,599
Give me the 200,000 you owe me,

861
00:40:30,320 --> 00:40:31,119
and I'll leave right away.

862
00:40:31,440 --> 00:40:32,400
Don't try to hide.

863
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:34,039
I know where your son works.

864
00:40:34,199 --> 00:40:34,719
Three days.

865
00:40:35,440 --> 00:40:36,280
I'm giving you three days.

866
00:40:38,760 --> 00:40:39,679
Think it over.

867
00:40:49,519 --> 00:40:49,880
Oh, right.

868
00:40:51,199 --> 00:40:52,239
I have that car.

869
00:40:53,159 --> 00:40:54,000
It wasn't destroyed.

870
00:40:59,800 --> 00:41:00,920
He came to extort me,

871
00:41:01,719 --> 00:41:02,800
and threatened me.

872
00:41:03,360 --> 00:41:04,599
If I didn't give him money,

873
00:41:06,039 --> 00:41:08,119
he'd make trouble at Xiaoyuan's school

874
00:41:09,320 --> 00:41:11,519
and ruin Chen Yuan's promotion.

875
00:41:12,639 --> 00:41:13,719
In all my life,

876
00:41:14,280 --> 00:41:15,719
I've done so many wrong things,

877
00:41:16,880 --> 00:41:18,039
all for Xiaoyuan.

878
00:41:18,679 --> 00:41:20,400
If he dared mess with Xiaoyuan,

879
00:41:21,079 --> 00:41:22,360
I'd never let him off.

880
00:41:28,519 --> 00:41:29,320
Director Zheng,

881
00:41:30,880 --> 00:41:32,679
this photo is fake.

882
00:41:33,119 --> 00:41:34,519
You've been duped.

883
00:41:35,199 --> 00:41:37,800
Cao Jun showed me that photo.

884
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:40,679
The engine number was right on it.

885
00:41:41,400 --> 00:41:43,239
That car is still out there.

886
00:41:48,960 --> 00:41:50,039
He blackmailed you.

887
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:54,440
He demanded 200,000 from me.

888
00:41:55,639 --> 00:41:57,559
I... I can't come up with that much.

889
00:41:58,360 --> 00:42:00,840
Do you think the two of us could...

890
00:42:01,559 --> 00:42:02,519
pool our money?

891
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:15,239
Once he gets to Hainan, he'll realize

892
00:42:15,679 --> 00:42:17,159
200,000 won't get him anywhere.

893
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:19,239
What happens then?

894
00:42:22,880 --> 00:42:23,760
That's true.

895
00:42:30,360 --> 00:42:31,519
For the rest of his life,

896
00:42:32,039 --> 00:42:33,559
he's going to leech off you.

897
00:42:33,960 --> 00:42:34,880
Old Chen,

898
00:42:35,559 --> 00:42:36,400
this whole thing,

899
00:42:36,760 --> 00:42:39,239
you need to figure it out yourself.

900
00:42:39,679 --> 00:42:40,159
Right.

901
00:42:40,159 --> 00:42:42,639
That's why I came to figure it out with you.

902
00:42:44,159 --> 00:42:45,599
What's there to figure out with me?

903
00:42:46,880 --> 00:42:48,000
You were the one driving.

904
00:42:48,840 --> 00:42:50,199
You were the one who fled the scene.

905
00:42:50,400 --> 00:42:52,280
And you forced liquor down his throat!

906
00:42:53,679 --> 00:42:54,760
The one driving was clearly...

907
00:42:55,039 --> 00:42:56,199
It was clearly you!

908
00:42:56,400 --> 00:42:58,159
I've never had a license my whole life.

909
00:42:58,199 --> 00:42:59,360
How could I drive?

910
00:43:00,679 --> 00:43:01,880
You drove the car!

911
00:43:02,039 --> 00:43:03,199
You were speeding!

912
00:43:03,320 --> 00:43:04,440
You crashed it!

913
00:43:04,559 --> 00:43:06,719
And you made me pour liquor into him!

914
00:43:06,920 --> 00:43:07,760
You... Chen Qingchun!

915
00:43:07,880 --> 00:43:09,719
Are you drunk and talking nonsense?

916
00:43:10,079 --> 00:43:10,760
If you keep this up,

917
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:12,360
I'll have Chen Yuan come take you home.

918
00:43:13,119 --> 00:43:15,119
I'm not putting up with your drunken antics.

919
00:43:25,800 --> 00:43:27,199
If you want to give it,

920
00:43:27,280 --> 00:43:28,079
then give it.

921
00:43:29,039 --> 00:43:30,159
If you don't want to,

922
00:43:30,400 --> 00:43:31,360
then drop dead.

923
00:43:35,800 --> 00:43:36,960
As for Cao Jun,

924
00:43:37,519 --> 00:43:38,760
he has a death wish.

925
00:43:40,320 --> 00:43:40,960
Right, Ali?

926
00:43:42,360 --> 00:43:44,079
Our Ali is much more obedient.

927
00:44:03,920 --> 00:44:05,320
I reviewed the old unused footage

928
00:44:06,280 --> 00:44:07,400
and noticed a few things

929
00:44:08,119 --> 00:44:09,519
that might be clues for your case.

930
00:44:09,519 --> 00:44:12,519
He had feelings for Liu Xuemei.

931
00:44:12,760 --> 00:44:13,760
That could also be

932
00:44:13,760 --> 00:44:16,239
Liu Tieping's motive for killing Qian.

933
00:44:16,239 --> 00:44:17,519
Put them both under surveillance now.

934
00:44:17,639 --> 00:44:18,679
It's an emergency!

935
00:44:19,000 --> 00:44:20,239
I don't know what happened to Cheng,

936
00:44:20,239 --> 00:44:21,280
but he was loaded into an ambulance.

937
00:44:21,599 --> 00:44:22,559
Liu Tieping is with him too.

938
00:44:23,079 --> 00:44:23,679
Damn it.

939
00:44:24,079 --> 00:44:24,880
Call Brother Chuang!

940
00:44:25,599 --> 00:44:26,559
We lost Liu Tieping!
